            <ArticleTitle>[A first trial in the clinical study of bonnecor].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>65-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The brief data on the results of the clinical trials of a new antiarrhythmic drug bonnecor at intravenous administration performed in six clinical institutions of the country are presented. A high effectiveness and a good tolerance of the drug in VT, VE, ST, SE and WPW syndrome were revealed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
